# The HUD's pictures: Show icons on the HUD's menu turns hud1.displayicons over, and the HUD then
# draws the battery, the GPS fix, Vibe, EKF and - disarmed - the pre-arm state as HUDT's pictures
# in place of their text: the battery at the left edge with its numbers beside it, the fix at the
# right of the bottom strip, Vibe four and EKF five pictures in, the pre-arm picture above EKF's.
# The click rectangles for Vibe and EKF move with them (vibehitzone, ekfhitzone). Clicked again,
# the text is back. `GCSViews/FlightData.cs:6484-6496, ExtLibs/Controls/HUD.cs:2861-2899,
# 2997-3009, 3150-3301`
#
# The pictures are Mission Planner's bitmaps, which this application does not ship; each is drawn
# as what it shows, in its colours and its rectangle (crates/mp-gui/src/hud.rs, "The pictures").
#
# Depends on fly.rs enabling the menu entry (fly-hud-showicons); until then it is dimmed and this
# fails at the first expectation after the click. Every rectangle and every level's picture is
# proved by the unit tests in crates/mp-gui/src/hud.rs; the zones below are the facts' 800 by 260
# scene's, whose font is 9.
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760, disarmed, at rest and past its start-up: a full pack,
# a 3D fix, vibration and EKF settled, the pre-arm checks passing. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/hud-icons.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen fly
window 1600x1200
settle 6

# Text, as HUD_showicons leaves it with nothing saved.
expect hud.icons none
expect hud.gps ~ GPS:
expect hud.vibe.colour white
expect hud.zone.vibe 638,239,40,18
expect hud.zone.ekf 593,239,40,18

click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-showicons
settle 1
expect hud.icons ~ batt_
# The GPS picture is the fix SITL reports (RTK fixed here) and the pre-arm one its readiness;
# the pictures' presence is the test, not the vehicle's state.
expect hud.icons ~ _wide,vibe_green,ekf_green,prearm_
expect hud.gps none
expect hud.vibe.colour none
expect hud.ekf.colour none
expect hud.prearm none
# The numbers stay, beside the battery, without "Bat1".
expect hud.battery.lower ~ v
expect hud.zone.vibe 617,238,51,17
expect hud.zone.ekf 561,238,51,17

# Clicked again, the text is back.
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-showicons
settle 1
expect hud.icons none
expect hud.gps ~ GPS:
expect hud.vibe.colour white
expect hud.zone.vibe 638,239,40,18
